
# Uganda Tax Engine (Mini-Project 2)

An Object-Oriented, statutory-compliant Python tax engine for computing Uganda Revenue Authority (URA) liabilities (Income Tax Act Cap 340, NSSF Act Cap 222, VAT Act Cap 349).

## Repository Structure
- `src/tax_engine.py`: Core domain logic (`Money`, `TaxContext`, `PAYETax`, `NSSFContribution`, `TaxPlanner`).
- `tests/test_tax_engine.py`: Unit test suite (boundary tests, Hypothesis property-based tests, exception tests).
- `project2_tax_engine.ipynb`: Demonstration notebook with live scenarios and discussion questions.
- `requirements.txt`: Project dependencies.
- `pytest.ini`: Pytest configuration.

## Setup & Running Instructions

### 1. Install Dependencies
```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt